{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong> wake up in an abandoned carnival. Rusted rides, flickering lights, eerie silence. You don\u2019t remember how you got here, but something feels off. Something <i>wrong</i>. A voice echoes through the empty fairgrounds: playful, mocking, inhuman. A clown has chosen you for his game. Solve his puzzles. Win his challenges. Earn your freedom. But there\u2019s a catch\u2026<br>If he <i>sees</i> you, he hunts you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924880/extras/396dfac75711688eeeb522985c5df4f2.avif?t=1759451034\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each</strong> area of the carnival holds its own sinister trial: intricate puzzles, deadly traps, and chilling surprises. As you explore deeper, the lines between reality and nightmare begin to blur. You're not just fighting to escape the carnival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what if you never do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924880/extras/8a041ab5555f7a4e899efd524817e9c2.avif?t=1759451034\" width=1600 height=864 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucid Dreams</strong> is a psychological horror puzzle game where stealth, wit, and courage are your only tools. Explore a hauntingly atmospheric world, uncover hidden secrets, and try to survive the game of a mad clown\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924880?t=1759451034","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924880/bbbf69bd3c9c240275a57fe2cfcd7ce488ac94cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759451034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924880/d2235414487a67ba634d395e41c8c2a309cc0183/ca